            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Icy Demise"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, cold, evocation)\n\nWhen an ice golem is destroyed, its body explodes in a blast of frigid air and razor-sharp ice, dealing 2d6 slashing damage and 2d6 cold damage to creatures in a 20-foot emanation, with a 19 basic Reflex save."
