          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Creeping Cold"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, cold, evocation)\n\nWhen the ice golem gets a critical hit with a fist Strike, the target also takes 2d6 persistent cold damage and is slowed 1 for 1 round."
